          "id": 3394700056,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I don't have issue with adding the feature, but why is asterix \"master only\"?  Is it because we are trying to keep weekly_updates.py synced between the release branches (and the asterix updates can only be applied to master).  When we have 5.0 and 5.2, I would think we'd still want the asterix updates for those branches.",
